Object room15 "Laboratory"
with
  description "You're in the Discovery's laboratory. It's a room that houses all the results of the research carried out by scientists on their journey to unknown worlds. Some cabinets placed against the walls contain numerous test tubes and capsules of special material. One cabinet with a stained glass cover draws your attention. The only exit is north.",
  n_to room05,
has light;

