! Room 16: Lower Deck Corridor
!========================================
Object room16 "Lower Deck Corridor"
with
  description "You're in the corridor of the lower deck of the Discovery. Like on every deck, this one is like a hub with exits in every direction. The southern exit has a door with a placard on it. You can also go up.",
  n_to room17,
  s_to armoury_door,
  e_to room20,
