! Room 17: Storeroom
!========================================
Object room17 "Storeroom"
with
  description "You've entered a storeroom. The temperature is very low as this particular storeroom probably served as cold storage for foodstuffs. Yet, the supplies have been removed to make way for something else. The only exit is to the south.",
  s_to room16,
has light;

!----------------------------------------
! Storeroom
!----------------------------------------
Object "storeroom" room17
with
  name 'storeroom' 'room',
  description "It's one of the storerooms present on each deck of the ship. The temperature here is very low, possibly to prevent the block of ice from melting.",
has scenery;

!----------------------------------------
! Block of ice
!----------------------------------------
Object "block of ice" room17
with
  name 'block' 'of' 'ice',
  initial "A huge block of ice dominates the room.",
  description "The low temperature of the room seems to prevent the ice from melting. The translucency of the ice allows you to see that there's something horrible locked inside it. It reminds you of an old movie where a UFO crashed at the North Pole. The UFO's only occupant was frozen in a block of ice, so the scientists melted it, but things didn't end very well.",
  before
  [;
    Attack, Burn, Open, Search, Shoot:
      "You'd better not. Whatever is inside, it seems hibernated and harmless. You don't know what you could unleash by exposing it to the ambient temperature of the spaceship.";
    Eat:
      "Really?";
    Pull, Push:
      "It's very heavy. There would be no point in moving it somewhere else.";
    Touch:
      "As you're wearing the suit you can't actually feel the cold, but a shiver runs down your spine.";
  ],
has static;

